{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/929899-custom-monster-dhampir","id":929899,"title":"Custom Monster: Dhampir","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-11T12:40:20-07:00","id":929899,"title":"Custom Monster: Dhampir","content":"<b>DHAMPIR</b> (Follower ****, Guide **)<br /> <br /> A rare a mysterious species of undead, the Dhampir is the halfbreed child of a mortal female coupling with a male vampire. Initially, the child may appear to be human, but some time around puberty, it begins to manifest symptoms of its heritage, adopting modified traits from the Undead template. Dhampir are very rarely accepted by either of their lineages. To vampires, they are often seen as inferior and forced into slavery. While mortals typically see them as a weapon to be used against their own kind, and try to manipulate the Dhampir to become hunters. As a result of this mistrust and abuse, many Dhampir learn to become self reliant and rarely trust anybody. Dhampir live significantly longer than ordinary humans, but lack the immortality of a true member of the Undead.<br /> <br /> Dhampir are resistant to many weaknesses that the Undead suffer, though not completely immune to any of them. When confronted with the effects of sunlight, garlic, silver, holy water and the like, Dhampir suffer only half damage. However, they lack the Invulnerability of a true Vampire and can be slain in the same manner as that of a mortal, although with noticeably more trauma before succumbing to their injuries.<br /> <br /> Dhampir regain legend by consuming human blood, and replenish 1 point of Legend for each pint of blood consumed. For an ordinary human, this averages to 10 pints of blood before they are completely drained. Pints taken from a Scion replenish 1 point of Legend for every dot of permanent Legend the Scion possesses.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Supernatural Powers:</b> <br /> <br /> <b>Claws and Fangs:</b> As with most undead, Dhampir possess a retractable set of claws and fangs they can use for combat and feeding, inflicting 2L damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Mixed Blood:</b> A Dhampir is not a true vampire, and as such, their blood is not as powerful as the rest of their kind. When consumed by a mortal, the Dhampir's blood function as a Jotunblut 2 enhancement, and does not have the power to turn them into members of the undead, regardless of the Dhampir's level of power.<br /> <br /> <b>Longevity: </b>After their powers manifest, the Dhampir's natural aging process is slowed to a crawl. For every decade that passes by, a Dhampir will only age one year.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Epic Attributes:</b> The Dhampir's attributes and knacks are the same as those of the Undead Template, with the following exceptions modified for their reduced Legend. Epic Dexterity 2 (Cat's Grace, Lighting Sprinter), Epic Appearance 2 (Come Hither, Meet Me Backstage)<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Join Battle:</b> 7<br /> <br /> <b>Attacks:</b> Bite: Accuracy 9, Damage 7L, Parry DV -, Speed 5<br /> <br /> <i>Clinch:</i> Accuracy 8, Damage 5L, Parry DV -, Speed 6, P<br /> <br /> <i>Unarmed Heavy:</i> Accuracy 7, Damage 10L, Parry DV 10, Speed 5<br /> <br /> <i>Unarmed Light:</i> Accuracy 9, Damage 7L, Parry DV 12, Speed 4<br /> <br /> <b>Soak:</b> 2A/4L/6B<br /> <br /> <b>Health Levels:</b> - 0x9/-4/Incap<br /> <br /> <b>Dodge DV:</b> 14 <b>Willpower:</b> 9<br /> <br /> <b>Legend:</b> 3 (higher individual Dhampir) <b>Legend Points:</b> 9<br /> <br /> <b>Trophy:</b> Dhampir do not have a trophy of their own, but may be found in possession of powerful relics.<br /> <br /> <b>Other Notes:</b> Dhampir who are taken as followers and guides are usually those who were raised by or indoctrinated into human society, rather than those who side with the vampires who spawned them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}